    "Fresh audit after all original durable hold deadlines proved17999successful payments/unique tickets, zero doublebooking/extra paid events, allqueues0 after recovery and no deadletters. One failed intake produced no order/payment; it is not an expired database order.",
    "Kafka peak74,last0 and six singleton owners observed. Backend callback-to-ticket p95283ms for the paidcohort; payment-due-to-callback p952994ms. Missing pipeline metrics prevent attributing pool/worker/DB contention or claiming full observed stability.",
